   "logo": "/legacy/imageFile/1643953329.jpg"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Installation of PORTACell Rigid has been successfully completed in the section of NH-2, Dhanbad, Jharkhand. A significant reduction in pavement thickness and construction time is observed. We shall look forward to working with Mtandt Ltd on our future projects.",
   "author": "Ashoka",
   "logo": "/legacy/imageFile/1669644218.jpg"
  },
  {
   "quote": "We have purchased an electric-operated articulated boom lift. From the date of commissioning, we have been continuously using this equipment and the same is giving is very satisfactory service. The after-sale service support extended by the dealer is very good.",
