   "logo": "/legacy/imageFile/1669643497.jpg"
  },
  {
   "quote": "We are using Mtandt boom lifts since the year 2020. We have used boom lifts of 45 ft and 60 ft, for our projects at ABB India Ltd & Hitachi Energy India Ltd and we are happy with your services and on-time support.",
